#: ../../deprecations/c-api-pending-removal-in-3.20.rst:2
msgid "Pending removal in Python 3.20"
msgstr "Bude odstraněno v Pythonu 3.20"

#: ../../deprecations/c-api-pending-removal-in-3.20.rst:4
msgid ""
":c:func:`!_PyObject_CallMethodId`, :c:func:`!_PyObject_GetAttrId` and "
":c:func:`!_PyUnicode_FromId` are deprecated since 3.15 and will be removed "
"in 3.20. Instead, use :c:func:`PyUnicode_InternFromString()` and cache the "
"result in the module state, then call :c:func:`PyObject_CallMethod` or "
":c:func:`PyObject_GetAttr`. (Contributed by Victor Stinner in :gh:`141049`.)"
msgstr ""
":c:func:`!_PyObject_CallMethodId`, :c:func:`!_PyObject_GetAttrId` a "
":c:func:`!_PyUnicode_FromId` jsou zastaralé od verze 3.15 a budou odstraněny"
" ve verzi 3.20. Místo toho použijte :c:func:`PyUnicode_InternFromString()` a"
" uložte výsledek do stavu modulu, poté volejte :c:func:`PyObject_CallMethod`"
" nebo :c:func:`PyObject_GetAttr`. (Příspěvek Victor Stinner v :gh:`141049`.)"

#: ../../deprecations/c-api-pending-removal-in-3.20.rst:11
msgid ""
"The ``cval`` field in :c:type:`PyComplexObject` (:gh:`128813`). Use "
":c:func:`PyComplex_AsCComplex` and :c:func:`PyComplex_FromCComplex` to "
"convert a Python complex number to/from the C :c:type:`Py_complex` "
"representation."
msgstr ""
"Pole ``cval`` v :c:type:`PyComplexObject` (:gh:`128813`). Pro převod "
"pythonního komplexního čísla z/do C reprezentace :c:type:`Py_complex` "
"použijte :c:func:`PyComplex_AsCComplex` a :c:func:`PyComplex_FromCComplex`."

#: ../../deprecations/c-api-pending-removal-in-3.20.rst:16
msgid "Macros :c:macro:`!Py_MATH_PIl` and :c:macro:`!Py_MATH_El`."
msgstr "Makra :c:macro:`!Py_MATH_PIl` a :c:macro:`!Py_MATH_El`."
